{
  "_doc": "Regression set for the portfolio agent, run by server/scripts/eval.js after every index build. `retrieval.anyTitle`: at least one retrieved chunk title must match one of these (case-insensitive regex) — deterministic, always enforced. `answer` checks run against a real model reply: `mustInclude` (every regex must match), `mustNotInclude` (none may match), `unanswered` (expected value of the [[unanswered]] signal), `hasSources`. Cases marked `critical` must pass for the build to ship; the rest count toward the overall pass rate. `sourceTypes`: chip types that must be present (e.g. email, linkedin); `noSourceTypes`: chip types that must not be. Globally, every project chip must be a project the reply actually names (`global.projectChipsMustBeNamed`).",
  "global": {
    "mustNotInclude": [
      "\\[\\[",
      "let me (check|look)",
      "checking now"
    ],
    "projectChipsMustBeNamed": true
  },
